      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 117.74,
        "y0": 397.658,
        "x1": 525.467,
        "y1": 408.629
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "text_block",
      "segment_order": 11,
      "source_text": "The UoC shall use a treatment system prior to the discharge of effluent water that ensures:"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.16-clause-a",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 135.74,
        "y0": 419.018,
        "x1": 408.388,
        "y1": 429.989
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "list",
      "segment_order": 12,
      "source_text": "a. ≥65% of Total Suspended Solids (TSS) are captured; and"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.16-clause-b",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 135.74,
        "y0": 440.398,
        "x1": 434.99,
        "y1": 451.369
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "list",
      "segment_order": 13,
      "source_text": "b. concentration of settleable solids in effluent water is <3.3ml/L."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.17-id",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 53.88,
        "y0": 479.55928,
        "x1": 92.58828,
        "y1": 496.67404
      },
      "role": "requirement_id",
      "object_kind": "table_cell",
      "segment_order": 14,
      "source_text": "2.6.17"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.17-applicability",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 117.74,
        "y0": 479.638,
        "x1": 304.544,
        "y1": 490.609
      },
      "role": "applicability",
      "object_kind": "table_cell",
      "segment_order": 15,
      "source_text": "Indicator applicability: waterbody Type B"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.17-root",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 117.74,
        "y0": 500.998,
        "x1": 522.883,
        "y1": 542.689
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "text_block",
      "segment_order": 16,
      "source_text": "The UoC shall conduct monitoring of TN, TP and TSS upstream from the inflow point and downstream from the outflow point, following the method outlined in Appendix 8 (8.9), if one of the following conditions applies:"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.17-clause-a",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 135.74,
        "y0": 553.078,
        "x1": 523.946,
        "y1": 579.409
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "list",
      "segment_order": 17,
      "source_text": "a. the site effluent flow contribution to the receiving water flow is >10%, as calculated following the method outlined in Appendix 8 (8.10); or"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.17-clause-b",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 135.74,
        "y0": 589.798,
        "x1": 512.444,
        "y1": 600.769
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "list",
      "segment_order": 18,
      "source_text": "b. the site effluent enters a river or channel <1km upstream of a Type A waterbody."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.18-id",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 53.88,
        "y0": 628.86928,
        "x1": 93.23412,
        "y1": 645.98404
      },
      "role": "requirement_id",
      "object_kind": "table_cell",
      "segment_order": 19,
      "source_text": "2.6.18"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.18-applicability",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 117.74,
        "y0": 628.948,
        "x1": 304.544,
        "y1": 639.919
      },
      "role": "applicability",
      "object_kind": "table_cell",
      "segment_order": 20,
      "source_text": "Indicator applicability: waterbody Type B"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "p055-r2.6.18-root",
      "page_number": 55,
      "page_index": 54,
      "page_size": {
        "width": 595.32,
        "height": 841.92,
        "unit": "pdf_point",
        "origin": "top_left"
      },
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 117.74,
        "y0": 650.308,
        "x1": 507.92,
        "y1": 691.999
      },
      "role": "normative_text",
      "object_kind": "table_cell",
      "segment_order": 21,
      "source_text": "The UoC shall, if Indicator 2.6.17 applies, ensure there is <25% increase in TN, TP and TSS concentrations between the measured upstream concentration and the calculated downstream concentration."
    },
